==Battleground==
*10 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Big Sal]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*15 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your goal is to burst down Lord Gravey before the inevitable horde of Big Sals overwhelms you. Bring ranged crowd-crontrollers like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] to stop the Lord Gravey and Coffin Zoges dead their tracks, then quickly whittle them down with high-DPS attackers such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] + [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to land the finishing blow. Be sure to bring either [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] or [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]] so that Big Sal doesn't inevitably one-tap your base.

